    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>You channel visions of a grim future into your target’s mind. Attempt a melee attack against the target’s EAC, adding the higher of your key ability modifier or your Strength modifier to the attack roll. On a hit, the target takes 6d10 damage and must attempt a Will saving throw. A target that fails is @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.conditions.Item.nywSVEeDvp1bk7L3]{Shaken} for the duration. One who succeeds is shaken for only 1 round, and then the spell ends.</p>\n<p>Casting this spell doesn’t provoke attacks of opportunity.</p>"
